== Overview ==
The '''Student Toilet''' is an enemy.
== Appearance ==
The Student Toilet is a darkish yellow toilet, with a neon yellow shirt. He is seen smirking, and wears a black beanie, slightly covering the top of his eyes.
== Waves ==
The Student Toilet is not restricted to any wave and can spawn at any time. Every time a wave ends, there is 0.1% chance that the wave will turn to "evil wave" and this enemy and the [[Teacher Toilet]] will spawn.
== Abilities ==
When near units, it becomes invulnerable for a few seconds 

== Strategy ==
Place down units to defeat the Student Toilet.

Avoid its *student rizz* ability in order to not get stunned by it.
== Trivia ==

* He is based off the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Jesse_Pinkman_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search Jesse Pinkman Skibidi Toilet] in the skibidi toilet series.
* He is based off [https://breakingbad.fandom.com/wiki/Jesse_Pinkman?so=search Jesse Pinkman] from the Breaking Bad series, along with the [[Teacher Toilet]], who is based off [https://breakingbad.fandom.com/wiki/Walter_White?so=search Walter White].
* This enemy does huge amounts of damage to your base, so it is better to kill it than ignore it.

